Only the 272 vision encoder and 4 multimodal projector tensors are included. No language
model weights. Tensor values are unchanged BF16. Names follow HF Pixtral and Mistral3, and
the rows of each attention wq and wk are reordered per head from Mistral's interleaved
rotary layout to HF's rotate-half layout. export_manifest.json records the SHA256 of
every source tensor before renaming.

modeling_pixtral_large4.py, projector.py and examples/inference.py come from the
vision-tower-bench repository under the MIT license in LICENSE-CODE. The modeling
file subclasses transformers' PixtralVisionModel (Apache-2.0) and follows the
numeric order of mistral-inference (Apache-2.0); it copies no code from either.
